HEI MuJoCo Simulation

This distribution packages the local simulation and demonstration collector
developed for the HEI ReBot Lift robot. Model assets and the scene builder are
derived from https://github.com/lipengdong/hei-rebot-lift at commit
40674132257099656a26ee7fd11cb67f80f25658.

The upstream repository is distributed under Apache License 2.0, with the
copyright notices retained in LICENSE and the source assets.

The YCB 011 banana mesh and texture have separate attribution requirements:
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
See licenses/YCB_BANANA_SOURCE.md and the SOURCE.md beside the banana assets.
The OBJ material reference is removed in memory during MuJoCo loading; the
original model/texture files are retained.

Local adaptations include physical free objects, contact/friction settings,
NoSlip and multi-contact solver configuration, three robot-mounted cameras,
position servos, optional fixed lift, and synchronized demonstration recording.
